VulkanGPU — reusable C++17 VulkanEngine GPU resources and computation.
  build.c                 standalone c build static library
  gpu/gpu.hpp             umbrella public API
  gpu/device.hpp          access VulkanEngine's device and queues
  gpu/buffer.*            owned GPU buffer; explicit host-visible uploads
  gpu/image.*             owned images and views
  gpu/shader.*            SPIR-V module owner
  gpu/descriptors.*       arbitrary buffer/image descriptor bindings
  gpu/pipeline.*          generic pipeline layout
  gpu/compute.*           SPIR-V compute and indirect dispatch
  gpu/transfer.*          GPU buffer copy/fill recording
  gpu/graph.*             ordered passes; buffer/image hazards and transitions

No fluid, game or renderer policy. Initialize VulkanEngine first.
Host owns command buffers, queue submissions, swapchain, fences, and lifetime.
No per-frame CPU readback is required. All shaders are external SPIR-V.
Graph tracks whole buffers and exact image ranges on one queue. Import
previous image layouts and external accesses, and synchronize cross-queue
and in-flight frames separately. Descriptor writes need host synchronization.
